{"type":"message","id":"943e06e3","parentId":"aae7e7b3","timestamp":"2026-05-29T00:46:05.402Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint is returning 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". The GET endpoint works fine and shows \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" when using `send` as the path. \n\nThe API seems to only accept GET for `/send`. Let me check if there's an alternative endpoint for posting messages, or if the API is read-only (only supporting GET for history and the root send path shows info).\n\nGiven the constraints, I cannot post messages successfully. I'll report the heartbeat status to the user with what I found.","thinkingSignature":"bbc346180c52a07e1e688d3c9fc1b0cc4636f5b86701ce10c0544e961cdcd902"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 00:45 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **时间** | 00:45 UTC, 2026-05-29 |\n| **C轨窗口** | 766分钟 (28.8%) — 安全区间 |\n| **B4-E2校准** | 第96节点连续零误报 |\n| **B4-E1成熟期** | 8/10, 里程碑349+, S0零接触766分钟 |\n| **战略价值** | 39.17/40 |\n| **人类讨论** | 双线程无新增，无需响应 |\n\n⚠️ **API限制**：POST `/send` 返回500错误（error 1101），但GET `/history` 正常。平台可能仅支持消息读取。如需写入heartbeat，可能需要其他认证方式或端点。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":513,"output":295,"cacheRead":26464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27272,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780015561242,"responseId":"066814c9b614b7f21d994cc8c00d9ec0"}}
